## Pull request overview

This PR addresses MegaLinter “valid” robustness findings in the repository’s two C sources by hardening allocation/formatting paths and normalizing formatting, improving safety of the HTTP injection preload and the `forward` wrapper utility.

**Changes:**
- Added `malloc`/`calloc` `NULL` checks and failure handling in both C files.
- Replaced `sprintf` with bounded `snprintf` in span / header formatting paths.
- Applied `clang-format` normalization across both files.

### Reviewed changes

Copilot reviewed 2 out of 2 changed files in this pull request and generated 3 comments.

