| ---- | ----------- |
| `src/usr/share/opentelemetry_shell/agent.instrumentation.http/agent.injection.http_header.c` | Hardens HTTP injection helpers (allocation checks, bounded formatting); reformats for consistency. |
| `actions/instrument/job/forward.c` | Adds allocation failure handling for command reconstruction and argv forwarding; reformats for consistency. |




